{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"2def5c2e3b4c7fe2","type":"group","x":-2080,"y":1280,"width":2980,"height":1160,"label":"Core state machine"},
		{"id":"f6173843210b49ec","type":"group","x":-1720,"y":-440,"width":460,"height":520,"label":"github "},
		{"id":"ea375b7b45f910c2","type":"group","x":-1000,"y":-400,"width":290,"height":380,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"68e51e407afe75a6","type":"group","x":-640,"y":-400,"width":290,"height":380,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"6281047f84a94a30","type":"group","x":-300,"y":-400,"width":290,"height":380,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"7cafb43c6a077e13","type":"group","x":60,"y":-390,"width":290,"height":370,"label":"Untitled group"},
		{"id":"c8bbfadd8096ae3b","type":"text","text":"## Latest pointer\nSwapped **atomically** on publish.\nOnly moves forward.\nLatest = highest version number, always.","x":-320,"y":1360,"width":240,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f5c7acdd8fa7c0d6","type":"text","text":"## Version N\nImmutable snapshot\n\nCreated only by publish.\nNever edited in place.","x":-1130,"y":1385,"width":260,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"8b0ccf2622d1fe4d","type":"text","text":"## Executions\nPin `version_id` **at start**.\nEngine loads definition by `version_id` only — never by `workflow_id + latest`.\n\nNew runs resolve latest once, at trigger time. Versions referenced by a run can't be deleted.","x":460,"y":1345,"width":320,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b11c01ec93a0d4f7","type":"text","text":"## Rollback (roll-forward)\nV2 broken → Restore V1 → copies V1 content into the draft slot → publish → **V3** carries V1's behavior.\n\nHistory stays linear; latest never moves backward.","x":460,"y":1810,"width":320,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1e281b8c6988ae14","type":"text","text":"## Version N+1\nImmutable snapshot","x":-320,"y":1860,"width":240,"height":120,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"1b54997d2bf38c92","type":"text","text":"## Core invariants\n1. Published versions are immutable; only drafts mutate\n2. At most one draft per workflow — edit redirects into it\n3. Publish = draft → version N+1, never version → version\n4. Latest is a pointer, atomic swap, forward-only\n5. Executions pin their version at start\n6. Referenced versions can't be deleted\n7. Rollback = roll-forward (restore content → republish)","x":380,"y":2080,"width":480,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e6271a0efe97aab0","type":"text","text":"## Editing\nCreate or iterate on the workflow","x":-1780,"y":1345,"width":260,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4ed53f6b3bff0bd5","type":"text","text":"## Draft\nMutable, unpublished\n\n`forked_from: null | VN`\nOnly **one** draft per workflow (or none)","x":-1780,"y":1810,"width":260,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b7a4565bf4090103","type":"text","text":"## New draft\nCopy of Version N\n\nEditing a published version **forks** — it never mutates.","x":-1130,"y":1840,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"da2712ff8223866f","type":"text","text":"## Inversion — failure modes designed out\n- Lose user's work → persistent draft + `updated_at` save check\n- Break in-flight runs → immutability + version pinning\n- Ambiguous latest → single pointer inside publish transaction\n- Impossible rollback → versions never mutated/deleted while referenced\n- Publish garbage → validation gate; publish may fail\n- Tangled history → one-draft invariant ⇒ strictly linear","x":-1480,"y":2520,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"35ad7810be04aec1","type":"text","text":"## Open questions\n- [ ] Publish validation rules?\n- [ ] Delete workflow with pinned running executions?\n- [ ] Draft undo / autosave snapshots?\n- [ ] Version retention / pruning policy?\n- [ ] Restore UX: review-first or auto-publish?","x":-740,"y":2520,"width":420,"height":280,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"8db75bfc164685c9","type":"text","text":"## Decision log\n1. In-flight runs → **pinned**; only new runs use latest\n2. Drafts → **one or none** per workflow\n3. Publish? NO → draft stays editable forever\n4. Single-user product; keep `updated_at` check as two-tab insurance\n5. Rollback → **roll-forward**, not pointer repointing","x":-220,"y":2520,"width":480,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f2c213444e238590","type":"text","text":"version 1","x":-280,"y":-120,"width":250,"height":60},
